[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Out of the Darkness]
[00:14.64]Why was the girl in hospital?
[00:19.71]Nearly a week passed before the girl was able to explain what had happened to her.
[00:27.93]One afternoon she set out from the coast in a small boat and was caught in a storm.
[00:36.82]Towards evening, the boat struck a rock and the girl jumped into the sea.
[00:44.67]Then she swam to the shore after spending the whole night in the water.
[00:51.68]During that time she covered a distance of eight miles.
[00:57.91]Early next morning, she saw a light ahead.
[01:02.61]She knew she was near the shore because the light was high up on the cliffs.
[01:09.90]On arriving at the shore, the girl struggled up the cliff towards the light she had seen.
[01:18.84]That was all she remembered.
[01:22.09]When she woke up a day later, she found herself in hospital.
